{"kind": "mod", "id": 2639, "name": "Auto Shoulder Swap", "slug": "auto-shoulder-swap", "teaser": "A simple mod that enables syncing leaning and shoulder swapping.", "owner_name": "Devraccoon", "downloads": 5595, "favourites": 34, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "com.hazelify.stancesync", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Scripting", "category_id": 3, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T08:16:51.000000Z", "created_at": "2026-03-23T20:30:44.000000Z", "published_at": "2026-03-23T20:30:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.0 <4.1.0", "latest_version": "1.0.2", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<h3>So, what is this?</h3>\n<p>Inspired by <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2201/hollywoodcam\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">HollywoodCam</a> which is created by the almighty <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/user/72916/jankytheclown\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Janky</a>, I created this little offshoot mod as a standalone for those who, like me, only used HollywoodCam for the leaning. The configuration is more or less the same, with some variation; lean-shoulder-swapping works while you’re aiming with this mod. I have not noticed any problems with leaning during ADS, so I left it in.</p>\n<hr />\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li><strong>Extract the <code>BepInEx</code> folder into your source / root SPT folder, where SPT.Server is.</strong>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vKRw58b.gif\" alt=\"alt text\" /></li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Features &amp; Showcase</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>Syncing of left leaning and shoulder swapping;\n<ul>\n<li>Works for going into and out of a lean, and sync can be disabled independently;</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Disable leaning when in ADS;</li>\n<li>Disable leaning when in ADS <em>only if in ADS with a magnified optic</em>\n<ul>\n<li>This feature only works if the first ADS feature is active</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Video: <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yl1UOGN.gif\" alt=\"alt text\" /></h3></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Thank you to the almighty <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/user/72916/jankytheclown\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Janky</a> for his original code, of which I trimmed some and cut out so it could be used standalone.</p>\n<p>Thank you to me for, well, making it standalone? :)</p></div></div></div>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0 <4.1.0", "content_length": 3768, "downloads": 367, "published_at": "2026-03-24T19:25:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2639/auto-shoulder-swap/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0 <4.1.0", "content_length": 4559, "downloads": 423, "published_at": "2026-03-26T17:03:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2639/auto-shoulder-swap/1.0.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.2", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0 <4.1.0", "content_length": 4929, "downloads": 4805, "published_at": "2026-03-29T21:26:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2639/auto-shoulder-swap/1.0.2", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": []}], "repos": ["minihazel/StanceSync"], "source_code_links": [{"url": "https://github.com/minihazel/StanceSync", "label": ""}], "required_by": 0, "no_repo": false, "obtainable": true, "dep_problems": 0}